  "2026-08-06T23:28:57.226Z",codex,"Verified exact-head review: defensive byIdOrFail and markdown narrowing already exist with direct behavior assertions; no coverage-ignore directive was added. Valid findings were fixed with exact pack assertions, per-test harness teardown, manifest validation, literal glob escaping, symlink-safe entry detection, deterministic filesystem failure injection, and discriminating fixtures."
